# The icon set of both apps: one name and one SVG path per line, in a 24x24 box, stroked
# at 1.8 with round caps and joins. src/ui/icons.tsx puts a path into an <svg>;
# desktop/src/icons.rs flattens it into polylines for egui. M, L, H, V, A and Z, absolute
# and relative, are all the path language either reader knows.
